WEBVTT

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>GUNDAM</i>

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>MOBILE SUIT</i>

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:17.870
<i>hoshi ga furishikiru penthouse de
In the penthouse that watches the stars fall...</i>

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:24.040
<i>sora no ORUGO-RU hitori kiiteta
I listened to Heaven's music box...</i>

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:30.460
<i>GARASU no RO-PU wo mekakushi de wataru
Walking, blindfolded, across a tight-rope of glass...</i>

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:37.090
<i>minna sabishii SA-KASU no kodomo sa
Everyone is like, the lonely child of the circus.</i>

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:45.020
<i>hitori bocchi no kanashimi ni
The rope that creaks with the sadness of isolation...</i>

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:50.770
<i>kishinda tsuna ga kokoro de yureteru...
...is still locked deep in my heart...</i>

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:07.830
<i>yasashii me wo shita dareka ni aitai
I wish to meet the one who's eyes glow with warmth!</i>

00:01:14.710 --> 00:01:25.980
<i>sasayaite kureyo soba ni iruyotte Silent Voice
Whisper to me that you'll always be there by my side, Silent Voice.</i>

00:01:34.310 --> 00:01:36.240
A clash began between
Chara's fleet...

00:01:36.240 --> 00:01:39.600
and Glemy's fleet,
which had Axis at its back.

00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:44.340
As the battle zone enlarged,
the Nahel Argama fell into danger.

00:01:44.340 --> 00:01:46.170
And it was Deputy
Captain Emary...

00:01:46.170 --> 00:01:49.840
who made herself our shield
because she missed Bright so much.

00:01:49.840 --> 00:01:53.470
I made a terrible mistake.

00:01:55.120 --> 00:01:59.250
THE BATTLE OF AXIS

00:02:17.020 --> 00:02:19.270
Chara Soon
is already leading...

00:02:19.270 --> 00:02:23.140
our fleets to Axis to
put down Glemy's rebellion.

00:02:23.140 --> 00:02:25.440
We will be supporting
her from the rear.

00:02:25.440 --> 00:02:29.600
If possible, our objective is to become
the vanguard to retake Axis!

00:02:29.600 --> 00:02:31.220
Do not underestimate the enemy!

00:02:31.220 --> 00:02:36.190
Axis's Newtype corps is far more
powerful than the Gundam Team!

00:02:36.190 --> 00:02:40.460
Brave soldiers of the Endra!
Who will win fame in this?

00:02:40.460 --> 00:02:43.930
Show no mercy to any who
have allied themselves with Glemy!

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:46.880
Even if they were once
your comrades in arms.

00:02:46.880 --> 00:02:51.640
Fate has surely decreed a
shining victory for Lady Haman!

00:02:51.640 --> 00:02:53.590
For evil, hand them
the wages of evil!

00:02:53.590 --> 00:02:57.060
For sin, hand them
the wages of sin!

00:02:57.860 --> 00:03:01.410
The imprinting he's undergone
for this situation is perfect!

00:03:01.410 --> 00:03:03.490
For evil, the wages of evil!

00:03:03.490 --> 00:03:05.230
For sin, the wages of sin!

00:03:05.230 --> 00:03:07.160
For evil, the wages of evil!

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:09.010
For sin, the wages of sin!

00:03:09.010 --> 00:03:11.250
For evil, the wages of evil!

00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:13.470
For sin, the wages of sin!

00:03:13.470 --> 00:03:15.700
For evil, the wages of evil!

00:03:15.700 --> 00:03:18.260
For sin, the wages of sin!

00:03:18.260 --> 00:03:20.490
For evil, the wages of evil!

00:03:20.490 --> 00:03:22.990
For sin, the wages of sin!

00:03:22.990 --> 00:03:25.490
For evil, the wages of evil!

00:03:33.720 --> 00:03:37.880
To look like an ally,
you must match his complexion.

00:03:37.880 --> 00:03:40.440
More so since I've
already raised my hand.

00:03:43.840 --> 00:03:47.440
If they say my blood is impure,
I'm content to accept that.

00:03:47.440 --> 00:03:50.930
But the next time we meet,
I'll cut her head clean off.

00:03:50.930 --> 00:03:54.550
And with my own hands, I'll rebuild
a kingdom of Zeon blood!

00:03:55.120 --> 00:03:56.750
Begone, Haman!

00:04:06.730 --> 00:04:09.840
Still no sign of Earth
Federal Forces reinforcements...

00:04:09.840 --> 00:04:12.020
entering Side 3 airspace.

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:15.950
As I'd expect. It's called
profiting while others fight.

00:04:15.950 --> 00:04:20.390
But, this sector is controlled by
the will of Newtypes like us.

00:04:20.390 --> 00:04:22.390
We won't allow ordinary
people to enter it!

00:04:22.390 --> 00:04:24.300
That's right.

00:04:24.300 --> 00:04:28.330
Listen to me as you work!
Soldiers of Zeon!

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:31.440
The time of our
submission is past!

00:04:31.440 --> 00:04:34.550
The root of evil is the one
who's been using Princess Mineva...

00:04:34.550 --> 00:04:39.460
in an attempt to inherit
a falsified Zeon: Haman Karn!

00:04:40.200 --> 00:04:43.090
To mold a true
Neo Zeon with my hands,

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:46.720
I charge you with the task
of bringing me her head!

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:51.380
The one who does shall be
known forever as the hero of space!

00:04:51.380 --> 00:04:54.090
He may be young,
but he has a gift for words.

00:04:54.090 --> 00:04:55.300
Bring him Haman's head?

00:04:55.460 --> 00:04:59.500
- Think he'd give a colony for that?
- More like a continent on Earth!

00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:02.300
I liked that, Glemy.
It's what I like about you.

00:05:02.300 --> 00:05:04.840
It wasn't to make you happy.

00:05:04.840 --> 00:05:08.130
For these people, who until yesterday
had pledged Haman their loyalty,

00:05:08.130 --> 00:05:11.590
I must be prepared
to offer Earth itself.

00:05:12.530 --> 00:05:16.240
You'd repaint the six suits of our
glorious team with this ugly color?!

00:05:16.480 --> 00:05:18.980
M-Master Glemy ordered it!

00:05:18.980 --> 00:05:22.760
He said for the true Neo Zeon,
we must become one!

00:05:22.760 --> 00:05:27.290
Not a bad idea to
reassure wavering troops.

00:05:27.290 --> 00:05:30.110
But there are exceptions!

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:34.880
Get me Glemy!

00:05:35.520 --> 00:05:39.350
Master Rakan Dahkaran
wishes to speak with you.

00:05:40.460 --> 00:05:42.660
What do you want?

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:50.120
Yes. I understand, Rakan.

00:05:50.120 --> 00:05:53.420
It's true that only our forces
have Doven Wolf mobile suits.

00:05:53.420 --> 00:05:55.990
So do as you like.

00:05:57.040 --> 00:06:00.690
How trivial. Just worrying
about appearances!

00:06:00.690 --> 00:06:03.050
When he may be dead
before too long.

00:06:14.920 --> 00:06:16.810
Don't hit the cameras, Beecha!

00:06:16.810 --> 00:06:18.680
Sorry, sorry!

00:06:18.680 --> 00:06:22.060
Hurry up with sorting the recovered
supplies from the La Vie en Rose!

00:06:22.530 --> 00:06:25.090
We're doing it!

00:06:25.090 --> 00:06:26.890
The storage bay's already full.

00:06:26.890 --> 00:06:30.190
If we get any more, we won't
be able to sort out the mess!

00:06:30.190 --> 00:06:32.020
Should we just
dump the whole lot?

00:06:32.020 --> 00:06:34.490
Milly said that
we'll need all of this.

00:06:34.490 --> 00:06:38.350
Except this is just going to
get in the way during a battle.

00:06:39.050 --> 00:06:40.830
Your call, Keithron.

00:06:40.830 --> 00:06:42.270
I suppose.

00:06:42.270 --> 00:06:46.000
Please, at least recover the
La Vie en Rose's black box!

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:49.660
It'll have Deputy Captain Emary's
last words recorded on it!

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:52.250
We're looking for it.

00:06:52.250 --> 00:06:55.310
There's a ton of stuff here
that all looks the same.

00:06:56.730 --> 00:06:58.680
Is this it?

00:06:58.680 --> 00:07:01.430
The floppy disc with
Miss Emary's voice on it.

00:07:02.040 --> 00:07:05.590
Don't worry, Deputy Captain Emary.

00:07:05.590 --> 00:07:09.140
I'll make sure that
Captain Bright gets this...!

00:07:14.820 --> 00:07:16.970
The atmosphere's getting
kinda heavy in here.

00:07:16.970 --> 00:07:18.640
Think the air
conditioning's broken?

00:07:18.640 --> 00:07:20.710
How can you make
jokes at a time like this?!

00:07:20.710 --> 00:07:22.210
What kind of jerk are you?!

00:07:22.210 --> 00:07:23.730
Your kind of jerk, I guess.

00:07:23.730 --> 00:07:25.480
Cut it out!

00:07:25.480 --> 00:07:27.510
Quit fooling around, Mondo!

00:07:27.510 --> 00:07:29.050
Then listen to me!

00:07:29.050 --> 00:07:32.730
Is being sad going to
bring the dead back to life?!

00:07:33.140 --> 00:07:35.990
What's done is done,
and we'd better forget it!

00:07:35.990 --> 00:07:38.670
When a person dies,
that's it for them!

00:07:38.670 --> 00:07:41.020
Except... except...

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:44.900
The rest of us have
to go on living!

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:48.420
You say that, and you'll die
sooner than others!

00:07:49.380 --> 00:07:50.670
Mondo, wait!

00:07:50.670 --> 00:07:53.540
The Hyaku Shiki
still needs repairs.

00:07:53.540 --> 00:07:55.610
I'll be right behind you.

00:07:55.610 --> 00:07:58.110
It's not like Mondo isn't sad.

00:07:58.110 --> 00:08:01.860
He just lost someone
precious to him, too.

00:08:01.860 --> 00:08:03.480
Miss Rasara, you mean.

00:08:03.480 --> 00:08:07.240
He may be even sadder
than Miss Milly is right now.

00:08:12.640 --> 00:08:15.800
Mondo, where's Judau?

00:08:16.450 --> 00:08:19.200
He said he'd be down in a while.

00:08:19.200 --> 00:08:23.810
What can you do if you can't even
tend your own mobile suit?

00:08:26.760 --> 00:08:28.820
Oh, Mondo.

00:08:29.320 --> 00:08:32.980
We can't count on support
from the Federation Forces.

00:08:32.980 --> 00:08:36.090
The next time Glemy's
forces leave Axis...

00:08:36.090 --> 00:08:39.180
They'll ignore us and
go after Haman, right?

00:08:39.180 --> 00:08:40.230
Right!

00:08:40.230 --> 00:08:42.090
So, when they do,

00:08:42.090 --> 00:08:44.920
we'll hit Glemy from the side,
then go after Haman!

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:46.790
And we'll only
go after the flagships.

00:08:46.790 --> 00:08:49.740
Got something!
The Zeon are moving!

00:08:59.220 --> 00:09:01.440
It's Haman.

00:09:01.440 --> 00:09:05.880
Right. Now, Haman sees
Glemy as an enemy, too.

00:09:05.880 --> 00:09:09.050
But there's no guarantee
that Haman's on that ship.

00:09:09.050 --> 00:09:12.640
Meaning there's no guarantee
that she's not on it.

00:09:12.640 --> 00:09:14.880
Either way, the fact is Haman's...

00:09:14.880 --> 00:09:17.760
raised her entire army
and is headed for Axis.

00:09:17.760 --> 00:09:21.790
All we can do is follow after them
and observe the battle for Axis.

00:09:21.790 --> 00:09:24.740
Then we can figure out
what Haman's after.

00:09:37.230 --> 00:09:39.950
Haman's definitely
aboard that ship!

00:09:39.950 --> 00:09:41.730
Judau!

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:47.390
Whose side is Judau on?!

00:09:47.390 --> 00:09:48.680
Judau's getting ready for...

00:09:48.680 --> 00:09:51.390
his final showdown with Haman.
Can't you see that?!

00:09:51.390 --> 00:09:55.490
Final showdown? As in,
one of them's going to die?

00:09:55.490 --> 00:09:57.750
Why do you have to
go to extremes?!

00:10:05.620 --> 00:10:06.670
Um...

00:10:06.670 --> 00:10:10.170
In a country called Japan,
before warriors went into battle,

00:10:10.170 --> 00:10:15.110
they'd spend the night with
their weapons, away from women.

00:10:15.110 --> 00:10:18.060
Sorry, Mr. Astonaige.

00:10:18.060 --> 00:10:20.470
You're being unusually
open today.

00:10:20.470 --> 00:10:23.090
Huh?
Is that new armor?

00:10:23.090 --> 00:10:28.190
Yeah, it's a multi-layered fluorocarbon
polymer put in a nematic state.

00:10:28.190 --> 00:10:30.460
It can deflect several seconds
worth of direct beam hits.

00:10:30.460 --> 00:10:31.700
Wow.

00:10:31.700 --> 00:10:34.530
But more than three
seconds and it'll burn off.

00:10:34.530 --> 00:10:35.700
Gotcha!

00:10:35.700 --> 00:10:38.970
Our target is the Neo Zeon
space fortress Axis!

00:10:38.970 --> 00:10:41.160
Aye, aye! Launching!

00:10:53.940 --> 00:10:56.990
Deploy more dummy asteroids!
Stay sharp!

00:10:56.990 --> 00:10:58.410
Aye, aye!

00:10:58.590 --> 00:11:01.890
I said stay sharp, didn't I?
Come with me!

00:11:01.890 --> 00:11:02.780
R-Right!

00:11:08.580 --> 00:11:11.620
- Ready, Nee? Lance?
- Right!

00:11:26.340 --> 00:11:28.750
Hiding in the shadow of
dummy asteroids...

00:11:28.750 --> 00:11:31.360
Cowards!
What can they do?!

00:11:38.930 --> 00:11:41.000
Impatience for victory
will lead to defeat, Rakan.

00:11:51.030 --> 00:11:53.180
It's begun.

00:11:53.180 --> 00:11:57.030
But, it will be Mashymre
who takes Glemy's head!

00:11:58.970 --> 00:12:01.380
The input seems
to have been perfect.

00:12:16.220 --> 00:12:18.990
Hear me, brave knights
of the Endra!

00:12:19.160 --> 00:12:23.080
I wish for today, this day,
to be Neo Zeon's greatest!

00:12:23.080 --> 00:12:26.670
Glemy is a traitor!
In short, he is evil!

00:12:26.670 --> 00:12:29.630
Now follow me
and let us punish his evil!

00:12:30.810 --> 00:12:34.550
Lady Haman's loyal servant.
Open the path of our victory.

00:12:37.740 --> 00:12:42.730
Now to show Lady Haman
that Glemy is no match for me.

00:12:55.340 --> 00:12:59.410
I can feel the power...
I will win this battle!

00:13:07.430 --> 00:13:10.420
It's been too long since
I've felt this thrill! Take this!

00:13:17.030 --> 00:13:18.220
Evade!

00:13:26.620 --> 00:13:28.810
Two of Chara's royal guard?

00:13:30.080 --> 00:13:31.650
You're just there for show!

00:13:32.290 --> 00:13:34.570
- That machine!
- It's Rakan!

00:13:34.570 --> 00:13:37.240
Have a taste of the
Doven Wolf's arms!

00:13:40.870 --> 00:13:43.290
What?! Damn you!

00:13:44.600 --> 00:13:47.030
You can't scare me with this!

00:13:47.030 --> 00:13:49.420
I have you now,
you little brats!

00:13:51.940 --> 00:13:53.880
Unusually quick. Hm?!

00:13:55.320 --> 00:13:57.010
It takes more than that!

00:13:59.090 --> 00:14:00.470
You dare...?!

00:14:11.120 --> 00:14:13.780
What is this?
This terrible pressure!

00:14:13.780 --> 00:14:16.280
Where's it coming from?
There?

00:14:20.220 --> 00:14:23.870
Chara?! No, not her.
It's Mashymre.

00:14:33.440 --> 00:14:37.800
How casually you approach me!
Have you no fear in your heart?!

00:14:58.710 --> 00:15:01.410
That Mashymre... he seems
to be holding his own.

00:15:02.220 --> 00:15:03.620
I have you!

00:15:08.140 --> 00:15:10.750
There's something
different about him!

00:15:23.610 --> 00:15:26.800
We're evenly matched.

00:15:26.800 --> 00:15:29.310
This could become a long battle.

00:15:33.120 --> 00:15:36.770
Now we know what's going on.
Haman's playing for keeps.

00:15:36.770 --> 00:15:38.780
We need to help her hit Axis!

00:15:38.780 --> 00:15:41.110
If we don't do it,
we'll be hit from behind!

00:15:41.710 --> 00:15:45.830
Right! Level 1 battle stations!
All hands, to your posts!

00:15:45.830 --> 00:15:47.790
- Judau, let's go!
- Right!

00:15:47.790 --> 00:15:49.330
Move it!

00:15:53.350 --> 00:15:55.790
What's wrong?

00:15:55.790 --> 00:15:57.880
I'm kinda mean, aren't I?

00:15:57.880 --> 00:15:59.260
What's with you?

00:15:59.260 --> 00:16:01.970
Even if you wory about me like this...

00:16:01.970 --> 00:16:03.930
I've always tried
to be nice to you.

00:16:03.930 --> 00:16:04.840
Really?

00:16:04.840 --> 00:16:07.510
It's just that somebody usually
has her mind somewhere else.

00:16:07.510 --> 00:16:08.760
She never notices.

00:16:08.760 --> 00:16:10.770
Huh? What do you mean?

00:16:10.770 --> 00:16:13.060
Don't make me say it again.

00:16:13.060 --> 00:16:14.440
All right!

00:16:14.440 --> 00:16:16.610
Let's go, Elle.

00:16:17.540 --> 00:16:20.190
Go on.
Everyone's waiting.

00:16:24.340 --> 00:16:26.700
Look, if I make it back alive,

00:16:26.700 --> 00:16:29.660
will you say that
to me again, Beecha?

00:16:31.140 --> 00:16:33.290
Deputy Captain!

00:16:33.290 --> 00:16:37.380
Deploy dummy asteroids!
Camouflage the Gundam Team's launch!

00:16:37.380 --> 00:16:38.380
Aye, aye!

00:16:49.410 --> 00:16:52.060
Will I survive and go
back to Shangri-La?

00:16:52.060 --> 00:16:54.560
You'll go back, Big Brother.

00:16:54.560 --> 00:16:56.060
Together with Leina.

00:16:56.060 --> 00:16:57.690
What's up, Double Zeta?

00:16:57.690 --> 00:17:00.610
Huh? Nothing.
Ready to launch!

00:17:37.120 --> 00:17:38.600
Rakan Dahkaran?

00:17:39.120 --> 00:17:41.690
Hmpf! Chara, show me
what you can do.

00:17:41.920 --> 00:17:44.360
Don't run away
like your little lackeys!

00:17:44.540 --> 00:17:46.820
Shut your mouth!

00:17:53.010 --> 00:17:54.290
Not bad.

00:17:54.290 --> 00:17:56.460
I don't see any beam
cannons on your back!

00:17:56.460 --> 00:17:58.460
You're a fool, Rakan!

00:18:11.240 --> 00:18:12.930
Chara! You okay?!

00:18:13.870 --> 00:18:17.310
Judau?
Judau, it's been a while!

00:18:17.910 --> 00:18:20.860
Judau, why are you helping me?

00:18:21.020 --> 00:18:23.360
Huh? What do you
mean, Chara?

00:18:24.630 --> 00:18:27.860
Did I imagine that?
I heard Judau's voice.

00:18:27.860 --> 00:18:29.070
Chara, what's wrong?!

00:18:29.070 --> 00:18:30.780
Again!

00:18:30.780 --> 00:18:32.160
Mistress Chara, are you all right?

00:18:32.160 --> 00:18:35.620
Of course! It'll take more
than that to kill Cat-Eyed Chara!

00:18:35.620 --> 00:18:38.500
And what's the
Double Zeta doing here?

00:18:38.850 --> 00:18:41.000
Repaying an old debt.

00:18:41.000 --> 00:18:43.340
Oh... that's a good
attitude to have.

00:18:43.340 --> 00:18:45.550
There it was again!
I heard Judau's voice!

00:18:45.550 --> 00:18:47.010
Mistress Chara! What's wrong?!

00:18:47.260 --> 00:18:48.260
Shut up!

00:18:48.260 --> 00:18:51.090
Don't yell at me!
You're cracking my head open!

00:18:51.090 --> 00:18:52.890
Where are you going?!
Mistress Chara!

00:18:53.100 --> 00:18:55.310
My head's aching!
Forget about me!

00:18:56.910 --> 00:18:58.980
What's wrong, Chara Soon?!

00:18:58.980 --> 00:19:02.310
This is your fault!
She acts strangely around you!

00:19:11.510 --> 00:19:14.070
Hm? Ple-Two is being
pushed back?

00:19:17.720 --> 00:19:20.410
Shall I charge
straight into them?

00:19:22.310 --> 00:19:26.170
No. Glemy still hasn't
sent out all his forces.

00:19:26.170 --> 00:19:29.970
Perhaps I should feign retreat
to draw his forces out.

00:19:54.130 --> 00:19:56.280
We've got you, Mashymre!

00:20:00.350 --> 00:20:02.330
Child's play!

00:20:06.230 --> 00:20:10.300
Don't worry. I'll end your
suffering right now! Do it!

00:20:17.740 --> 00:20:21.480
They bounced off?!
What did you do, Mashymre?!

00:20:30.920 --> 00:20:32.780
You cannot kill me!

00:20:32.780 --> 00:20:37.200
Mashymre Cello will fight until the
flesh is cleaved from his bones!

00:20:39.430 --> 00:20:41.850
F-Fall back! Do it now!

00:20:41.850 --> 00:20:44.290
LONG LIVE LADY HAMAN!

00:20:47.640 --> 00:20:49.800
What's this light?!

00:20:59.490 --> 00:21:02.020
What? Someone just died!

00:21:03.830 --> 00:21:05.140
Mashymre?!

00:21:09.620 --> 00:21:11.570
Mashymre!

00:21:14.550 --> 00:21:18.120
All that spirit he had when
he went out... it was just for show?

00:21:21.260 --> 00:21:23.660
Enhanced too much?

00:21:25.640 --> 00:21:31.000
And now, I've lost yet another
pawn to move as I wish.

00:21:33.610 --> 00:21:35.800
Mistress Chara!
Where are you going?

00:21:35.800 --> 00:21:37.510
They've killed Mashymre!

00:21:41.780 --> 00:21:43.020
Incoming!

00:21:43.020 --> 00:21:45.230
We can't handle that
pilot the same way!

00:21:45.230 --> 00:21:46.480
Then what do we do?!

00:21:46.480 --> 00:21:47.530
Retreat!

00:21:47.530 --> 00:21:49.100
You won't escape!

00:21:51.540 --> 00:21:53.190
Chara Soon, come back!

00:21:53.190 --> 00:21:54.990
I have to avenge Mashymre!

00:21:54.990 --> 00:21:57.570
That's an order! Return to
your duty in the royal guard!

00:21:57.570 --> 00:22:00.370
The enemy I must defeat
is right in front of me!

00:22:03.050 --> 00:22:05.540
What's going on?

00:22:06.310 --> 00:22:09.250
Wh-What? What's happening?

00:22:14.520 --> 00:22:17.510
What the hell is going on?

00:22:25.660 --> 00:22:27.730
What's...?

00:22:44.540 --> 00:22:50.820
<i>ikuyaku ikuman ikuoku no hoshi yo
Hundreds upon thousands upon millions of stars...</i>

00:22:50.820 --> 00:22:56.950
<i>naze hikaru dake nano ka kataru chikara no shiwase
...why do you just sit there and twinkle? Show me the power that lets me connect!</i>

00:22:56.950 --> 00:23:08.050
<i>Ima nara ore demo furikaerasu ni tobitatsu kokoro
For now, even I've got a mind that wanders without reminiscing past regrets!</i>

00:23:08.940 --> 00:23:13.930
<i>Hoshi no kazu dake inochi wo takuwareba
If lives are really stored in the form of stars...</i>

00:23:14.950 --> 00:23:19.940
<i>ginga no mure no hikari wo kaete misero
...show me how to change the light and move galaxies...</i>

00:23:20.620 --> 00:23:29.650
<i>kono te ga tsukamu inochi no omosa ni naru
The weight of life itself, will be held in my hands!</i>

00:23:29.650 --> 00:23:35.530
<i>mada meinai yo sora no michishirude wa
Space's guidepost is still not within my sights...</i>

00:23:35.530 --> 00:23:41.620
<i>kono te ni saware hikari isenmanen
Let the light of 10 million years touch this hand!</i>

00:23:47.570 --> 00:23:49.790
With the mobile suit battle
turning against him,

00:23:49.980 --> 00:23:53.400
Glemy hits Haman's fleet
with Mousa section of Axis.

00:23:53.400 --> 00:23:56.770
I face off against
Glemy and Ple-Two,

00:23:56.770 --> 00:23:58.980
but their momentum almost
seems to swallow me!

00:23:58.980 --> 00:24:02.910
Has Roux come to save me?
No, wait... Ple-Two?

00:24:03.160 --> 00:24:06.390
Next time, on Gundam ZZ:
"Vibration."

00:24:05.570 --> 00:24:08.680
Next Time

00:24:05.570 --> 00:24:08.680
VIBRATION

00:24:07.830 --> 00:24:09.940
Ple-Two, you're trying too hard!
